O0001 (STEPPED TRANSMISSION SHAFT - MILD STEEL)
(STOCK      : DIA 50 X 100 MM BAR, 1.0 MM FACING ALLOWANCE)
(FINISHED   : DIA 30 X 25 / DIA 40 X 30 / DIA 50 BALANCE)
(FEATURES   : FACING, STEP TURNING, 2X45 CHAMFER, 4X2 GROOVE, M30X1.5 THREAD)
(DATUM      : Z0 = FINISHED FACE, X0 = SPINDLE AXIS, X IS DIAMETER)
(TOOLING)
(T0101 : DCLNR 2525 M12 + CNMG 120408-PR   95 DEG ROUGH / FACE, R0.8)
(T0202 : SDJCR 2525 M11 + DCMT 11T304-PF   93 DEG FINISH, R0.4)
(T0303 : QD-LCH 2525 + QD-NH-0300          3 MM GROOVE / PART-OFF BLADE)
(T0404 : SER 2525 M16 + 16ER AG60          60 DEG EXTERNAL THREADING)
(NOTE  : GROOVE BLADE IS REFERENCED ON ITS +Z EDGE)

N10  G21 G40 G97 G99                (METRIC, COMP CANCEL, DIRECT RPM, FEED PER REV)
N20  G28 U0.0 W0.0                  (REFERENCE RETURN)

(================ OP 10 : FACING - G94 END FACE CYCLE ================)
N30  T0101
N40  G50 S2500                      (CLAMP MAX SPINDLE SPEED FOR CSS)
N50  G96 S180 M03                   (CONSTANT SURFACE SPEED 180 M/MIN)
