N70  G94 X-1.0 Z0.5 F0.20           (FACING PASS 1 - 0.5 MM)
N80  G94 X-1.0 Z0.0                 (FACING PASS 2 - TO FINISHED FACE)
N90  G00 X52.0 Z2.0

(================ OP 20 : ROUGH TURNING - G90 TURNING CYCLE ==========)
(LEAVE 0.5 MM ON DIAMETER FOR FINISHING)
N100 G96 S200 M03
N110 G90 X45.0 Z-55.0 F0.30         (ROUGH PASS 1 - DIA 45 OVER 55 MM)
