N130 G90 X35.5 Z-25.0               (ROUGH PASS 3 - SMALL STEP)
N140 G90 X30.5 Z-25.0               (ROUGH PASS 4 - DIA 30.5, 0.5 STOCK)
N150 G00 X200.0 Z200.0 M09
N160 G28 U0.0 W0.0

(================ OP 30 : FINISH PROFILE - G42 NOSE RADIUS COMP ======)
N170 T0202
N180 G50 S3000
N190 G96 S260 M03
N200 G00 X26.0 Z2.0 M08
N210 G42 G01 Z0.0 F0.12             (NOSE RADIUS COMPENSATION ON)
