N240 G01 X40.0                      (SHOULDER FACE TO DIA 40)
N250 G01 Z-55.0                     (FINISH DIA 40)
N260 G01 X50.0                      (SHOULDER FACE TO DIA 50)
N270 G40 G00 X200.0 Z200.0 M09      (COMPENSATION OFF, RETRACT)
N280 G28 U0.0 W0.0

(================ OP 40 : THREAD RELIEF GROOVE 4 WIDE X 2 DEEP =======)
(GROOVE SPANS Z-20.0 TO Z-24.0, BOTTOM DIA 26.0, 3 MM BLADE, 2 PLUNGES)
N290 T0303
N300 G97 S900 M03                   (DIRECT RPM FOR GROOVING)
N310 G00 X32.0 Z-21.0 M08
N320 G01 X26.0 F0.08                (PLUNGE 1 - COVERS Z-24.0 TO Z-21.0)
N330 G04 X0.5                       (DWELL TO CLEAN THE GROOVE BOTTOM)
N340 G00 X32.0
N350 G00 Z-20.0
N360 G01 X26.0 F0.08                (PLUNGE 2 - COVERS Z-23.0 TO Z-20.0)
N370 G04 X0.5
N380 G00 X32.0
N390 G00 X200.0 Z200.0 M09
N400 G28 U0.0 W0.0

(================ OP 50 : THREADING M30 X 1.5 - G92 THREAD CYCLE =====)
